=== End Stage (<code>endstage</code>) ===
A list of stage IDs, which correspond to various [[chapter]]s, for use with the <code>endstage</code> attribute.

This attribute sets the final stage of the challenge. This is where the trophy will spawn, after the floor boss is defeated. The trophy will also spawn on any next floor in case the player manages to continue.

* Setting the end stage to Chapter 9 ({{s|???}}) will prevent the trapdoor and light beam from spawning after defeating {{e|It Lives!}}, but unless the player has a {{t|Strange Key}} or the timer is under 30 minutes, the door to the Hush floor will not open, softlocking the run.
** Additionally, after defeating {{e|Hush}}, the portal to {{s|The Void}} will not open.
