=== Curses (<code>cursefilter</code> & <code>getcurse</code>) ===
A list of [[curse]] bitmasks, for use with the <code>cursefilter</code> and <code>getcurse</code> attributes.

Unlike other attributes which accept a comma-separated list, the two curse attributes accept a '''single number''', which is the combined total of all applicable curses.

For example, to apply Curse of the Labyrinth (<code>2</code>) and Curse of the Maze (<code>32</code>), the attribute value would be <code>34</code> (which is 32 + 2).
